---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section
  id="about"
  eyebrow="About"
  title="Who built it"
  subtitle="Aegis is my engineering laboratory — where I design, build and operate cloud-native, AI-powered platforms using the same principles expected in enterprise software."
>
  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_380px]">
    <div class="reveal space-y-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-card p-8">
      <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground">
        Engineering philosophy
      </h3>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
        {`I don't write code to type. I design systems, orchestrate specialized AI agents and
        deliver production value. Aegis is the proof: a payment platform architected, specified,
        implemented, tested and documented by a virtual engineering team under human direction.`}
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
        {`The result is production-grade software that would take a traditional team weeks to
        build — delivered in days, with the same or higher quality standards. The focus is
        understanding the business domain, translating it into rigorous specifications, and
        using AI as a force multiplier.`}
      </p>

      <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-l-primary pl-4 font-display text-lg text-foreground">
        “Aegis is my engineering laboratory where I design, build and operate cloud-native,
        AI-powered platforms using the same principles expected in enterprise software.”
      </blockquote>

      <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/AlexAlvarezGallardo-GitHub"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/10 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 hover:text-accent"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/10 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 hover:text-accent"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-card p-8">
      <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground">
        Professional profile
      </h3>
      <dl class="mt-6 space-y-5">
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Role</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-foreground">Software Engineer · Architect · AI Orchestrator</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Focus</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-foreground">Distributed systems, fintech, platform engineering, AI-native development</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Languages</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-sm text-foreground">Java · TypeScript · Angular · SQL</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Platform</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-sm text-foreground">Kafka · Kubernetes · Argo CD · GitOps</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
